commit 79d904e8
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 17:18:37 -0600
subject: fix(db): GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT x, sep) invalid in SQLite — dedupe via subquery

v3 merge (a236b6b3 connection IDs drill-down) used two-arg DISTINCT
aggregate which node:sqlite rejects with 'DISTINCT aggregates must
have exactly one argument'. Fix: SELECT DISTINCT in a subquery then
GROUP_CONCAT with separator. Also install jpeg-js (declared in
package.json, needed by open-sse/utils/kiroImage.js from v3 kiro work).

Resolves 13 NEW failures from regression gate (error-inbox x10,
kiro-external-idp x1, xai-oauth x2).

